The ADS-B Radar firmware (this component, and components/vfo_core adsb.c)
follows Alex-developer's ADSB-Radar (github.com/Alex-developer/ADSB-Radar,
forked as github.com/Guru-RF/ADSB-Radar): its feeds and the fields it reads
from them, its altitude bands and colours, its alerts and its routes. That
project's licence:

