OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE
SOFTWARE.

The map in tables/ is not ADSB-Radar's: tools/adsb_tables.py builds it from
public-domain data, Natural Earth's 1:50m coasts and land borders
(naturalearthdata.com) and OurAirports' airports (ourairports.com).
